{
 "_doc": [
  "Whether a tile draws its selection outline: `bind.selected_in` (SCHEMA.md",
  "`bind`, Standard Bindable Properties: the accent outline on color_swatch and the brush-tile container). Authored",
  "FROM THE SPEC (swatches.yaml sp_swatch_tile, brushes.yaml bp_tile), not by",
  "running a port. Generated by scripts/gen_tile_selected_in_fixture.py, whose `rule` computes each `expected`.",
  "",
  "The law. The tile's identity is its click behaviour's first `select.target`.",
  "It is selected when that identity is a member of the `selected_in` list.",
  "When that `select` also names a `scope` (a panel key) with a `scope_value`,",
  "the list belongs to that scope: `select` RESETS the list whenever the scope",
  "changes (effects.rs apply_select). So the tile is selected only when",
  "`panel.<scope>` equals its `scope_value` as well. A tile in another library",
  "at the same index is NOT selected.",
  "",
  "A tile with no `selected_in` bind, or no select target, is not selected; nor is one whose scope does not resolve (`panel.<scope>` absent).",
  "",
  "Case: {name, element, context, expected}. `element` is the tile as the",
  "workspace declares it; `context` is the evaluation scope (panel, the loop",
  "variables)."
 ],
 "cases": [
  {
   "name": "swatch_in_list_in_its_library",
   "element": {
    "id": "sp_swatch_tile",
    "type": "color_swatch",
    "bind": {
     "color": "swatch.color",
     "selected_in": "panel.selected_swatches"
    },
    "behavior": [
     {
      "event": "click",
      "effects": [
       {
        "select": {
         "target": "swatch._index",
         "list": "selected_swatches",
         "mode": "auto",
         "scope": "selected_library",
         "scope_value": "lib.id"
        }
       }
      ],
      "action": "set_active_color"
     },
     {
      "event": "double_click",
      "action": "open_swatch_options"
     }
    ]
   },
   "context": {
    "panel": {
     "selected_library": "web_colors",
     "selected_swatches": [
      3
     ]
    },
    "lib": {
     "id": "web_colors"
    },
    "swatch": {
     "_index": 3,
     "color": "#ff0000"
    }
   },
   "expected": true
  },
